There is a tape-release button just inside the case.

As you face the drive, it's just behind the faceplate, near the top of the
right side.
You'll need to pop the cover off whatever enclosure it's in, to see it.

If the tape is really rewound and disengaged, this should fully release the
cartridge.

If the tape is threaded, however, you need to approach the guts of the drive
from the top.
The takeup reel is located at the rear of the unit, and is nearly impossible
to reach without
removing the cover altogether.  It's more time consuming than difficult.

-Mike Duffy

