Hi Mathias:

Looks like you may have a defective tape leader. This is a common
problem with TK50s. The leader can't "hook" the start of the tape when
it's inserted, therefore it just keeps going, and going, and going...

You can buy the new leaders for about $5. I suggest that you post to
alt.folklore.computers, someone there will likely have a spare leader,
or be able to tell you where you can get one.

The classiccmp mailing list is another avenue, but ask on the newsgroup
above first. 

To join the classic computers list send mail to
majordomo@u.washington.edu with "subscribe classiccmp your-email" in the
body of the message.

Kevin

