Subject: Re: Fast matrix multiply and benchmark
Date: 1998/12/21
Message-ID: <367D9D1E.32A9@fy.no.chalmers.spam.se>
X-Deja-AN: 424347657
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 7bit
References: <75ca18$ss8$1@news01cc.so-net.ne.jp>
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=us-ascii
Organization: Chalmers University of Technology
