I agree about the VS4000-60/9x box design - I have no complaints. I was just 
pointing out that

a) the drives inherently run hotter than drives that do not rotate so quickly
b) the RZ29Bs will meltdown rapidly - within weeks or months at best - in some 
enclosures (early unmodified SW boxes, VS3100-76 boxes etc.)
