  Ok, so I couldn't resist using that title. :-)

..

:So you have got 6 GB, whats that going to do for 
:you, take away the OS, the apps, the DBMS if 
:you are running a database and you have probably 
:less than 4 GB for your SGA, a Sun E4500 
