References: <slrn74ckjr.l8a.rednoise@alphie.rednoise.net> <y4n254qn1o.fsf@mailhost.neuroinformatik.ruhr-uni-bochum.de> <1998Dec4.072650.1@eisner> <3667EAD0.CEAC319F@uk.sun.nospam.com> <366C62DC.446B9B3D@dial.pipex.com> <366E73B0.190A48A7@uk.sun.nospam.com>
