Actually, it was due to Bob GP Palmer's extensive ability to predict the
future and make it into a self fulfilliing prophecy.

Palmer knew that he would sabotabel Digital so that Compaq would buy it, but
he also knew that at the time Compaq was cash rich, DEC wouldn't be ready yet,
