time VMS would have been ready to support an FT on alpha, Digital was
continuing its downward slide and there would have been no market for it. (and
I beleive that the VAX-FT was still too young to have developped a sizeable
market prior to introduction of ALPHA so bean counters probably had an easy
job of justifying NOT porting FT to alpha.).



