: 
: I do not really know, because we've only one PWS. A PWS433au with NT (and
: only sometimes for small tests OpenVMS)
: 
: BUT I heard/read:
: 
: *) PWS a do not have enough flash memory to contain both AlphaBIOS and SRM.
: 	Personally I doubt. And if its true, you might replace AlphaBIOS
: 	with SRM (as you wrote). And if it doesn't work, you may even replace
: 	the Flash Chip, because the mother board should IMHO be the same...
